  "notes": "{頷|うなず}く specifically refers to the head-nodding motion that indicates agreement or acknowledgment.\n\nCONJUGATION (godan verb):\n- {頷|うなず}く (dictionary form)\n- {頷|うなず}かない (negative)\n- {頷|うなず}いた (past)\n- {頷|うなず}いて (te-form)\n\nKANJI NOTE:\nOften written in hiragana as うなずく or with okurigana as {頷|うなづ}く.\n\nRELATED EXPRESSIONS:\n- {首|くび}を{縦|たて}に{振|ふ}る: to nod (literally \"shake head vertically\")\n- {首|くび}を{横|よこ}に{振|ふ}る: to shake head (to indicate \"no\")",
